---

<section class="experience-section" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
	<div class="section-heading">
		<p class="eyebrow">WHAT I WORK ON</p>
		<h2 id="experience-title">Technical Experience</h2>
		<p>클라우드 운영을 중심으로 백엔드와 데이터, 웹 화면, 관측과 자동화까지 서비스가 전달되는 흐름을 다뤄 왔습니다.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="technology-categories">
		{categories.map((category) => (
			<section class="technology-category" aria-labelledby={`category-${category.id}`}>
				<h3 id={`category-${category.id}`}>{category.name}</h3>
				<ul class="badges" aria-label={`${category.name} 기술 스택`}>
					{category.technologies.map((technology) => (
						<li>
							<img src={technology.badge} alt={technology.name} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
						</li>
					))}
				</ul>
				<div class="category-details">
					{category.details.map((detail) => (
						<article>
							<h4>{detail.title}</h4>
							<p>{detail.text}</p>
						</article>
					))}
				</div>
			</section>
		))}
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.experience-section {
		margin: 4rem 0;
	}
	.section-heading {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.section-heading h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		color: var(--link);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
	}
	.technology-categories {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.4rem;
	}
	.technology-category {
		min-width: 0;
	}
	.technology-category + .technology-category {
		padding-top: 1.25rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
	}
	.technology-category h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
		color: var(--link);
		font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.35rem);
		line-height: 1.35;
	}
	.badges {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.55rem;
		min-width: 0;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}
	.badges li {
		display: flex;
		min-width: 0;
		max-width: 100%;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.badges img {
		display: block;
		max-width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}
	.category-details {
		max-width: 76ch;
		margin-top: 1.35rem;
	}
	.category-details article + article {
		margin-top: 1.1rem;
	}
	.category-details h4 {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		font-size: 0.98rem;
		font-weight: 650;
	}
	.category-details p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text);
		line-height: 1.75;
		opacity: 0.86;
	}
</style>
